Lathril, Blade of the Elves in BG, built to Bracket 3 rules. This guide is a starting point generated from the decklist — the sections below group what the deck actually contains by what each card is there to do.

# The commander
Lathril, Blade of the Elves :: Whenever Lathril deals combat damage to a player, create that many 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature tokens.

